#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:73
msgid ""
"*Regular Ledgers:* Each company in the consolidation scope has its own "
"standard accounting ledger where all the regular day-to-day transactions are "
"recorded. It excludes the company's consolidation adjustment journals."
msgstr ""
"*دفاتر الأستاذ العادية:* كل شركة في نطاق التوحيد لديها دفتر أستاذ محاسبي "
"قياسي خاص بها حيث يتم تسجيل جميع المعاملات اليومية العادية. وهو يستثني دفاتر "
"يومية تسويات التوحيد الخاصة بالشركة."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:77
msgid ""
"*Multi-Ledger for Consolidation:* The company doing the actual consolidation "
"also has a special multi-ledger. This one includes all the other companies' "
"consolidation adjustments journals (the ones excluded from their own "
"ledgers). This allows for viewing the total impact of all the adjustments."
msgstr ""
"*دفتر أستاذ متعدد للتوحيد:* الشركة التي تقوم بالتوحيد الفعلي لديها أيضًا دفتر "
"أستاذ متعدد خاص. يتضمن هذا الدفتر جميع دفاتر يومية تسويات التوحيد للشركات "
"الأخرى (تلك المستثناة من دفاترها الخاصة). وهذا يسمح بعرض الأثر الإجمالي "
"لجميع التسويات."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:82
msgid ""
"To create a new ledger, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --"
"> Multi-Ledgers` and hit the :guilabel:`New` button. Enter a name, pick the "
"company the ledger is linked to and most importantly, determine which "
"journals are to be excluded from the ledger."
msgstr ""
"لإنشاء دفتر أستاذ جديد، انتقل إلى :menuselection:`المحاسبة --> الإعدادات --> "
"دفاتر الأستاذ المتعددة` وانقر على زر :guilabel:`جديد`. أدخل اسمًا، اختر "
"الشركة المرتبطة بدفتر الأستاذ، والأهم من ذلك، حدد دفاتر اليومية التي سيتم "
"استثناؤها من دفتر الأستاذ."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:91
msgid ""
"**Multi-Company Selector:** The consolidated view can be accessed using the "
"multi-company"
msgstr ""
"**محدد الشركات المتعددة:** يمكن الوصول إلى العرض الموحد باستخدام محدد "
"الشركات المتعددة."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:89
msgid ""
"selector. Selecting the consolidating company as the current company and "
"making the other companies visible in the selector, all the journal items "
"are displayed from the consolidating company's perspective."
msgstr ""
"عند اختيار الشركة الموحدة كشركة حالية وجعل الشركات الأخرى مرئية في المحدد، "
"يتم عرض جميع بنود دفتر اليومية من منظور الشركة الموحدة."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:None
msgid "Selecting the main company and activating others."
msgstr "اختيار الشركة الرئيسية وتنشيط الشركات الأخرى."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:111
msgid ""
"**Horizontal Groups:** Odoo's reporting tools allow for combining multi-"
"ledgers and using"
msgstr ""
"**المجموعات الأفقية:** تسمح أدوات إعداد التقارير في Odoo بدمج دفاتر الأستاذ "
"المتعددة واستخدام"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:99
msgid ""
"horizontal groups to view the consolidated Balance Sheet or P&L. They also "
"show how much each company contributes to the overall consolidated figures."
msgstr ""
"المجموعات الأفقية لعرض الميزانية العمومية أو قائمة الأرباح والخسائر الموحدة. "
"كما أنها تظهر مدى مساهمة كل شركة في الأرقام الموحدة الإجمالية."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:102
msgid "Follow these steps to create an :guilabel:`Horizontal Group`:"
msgstr "اتبع هذه الخطوات لإنشاء :guilabel:`مجموعة أفقية`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:105
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Horizontal Groups` "
"and click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"انتقل إلى :menuselection:`المحاسبة --> الإعدادات --> المجموعات الأفقية` "
"وانقر على :guilabel:`جديد`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:107
msgid ""
"Add a :guilabel:`Group Name` and select the :guilabel:`Reports` where the "
"horizontal group can be used."
msgstr ""
"أضف :guilabel:`اسم المجموعة` واختر :guilabel:`التقارير` التي يمكن استخدام "
"المجموعة الأفقية فيها."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:109
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Field` column, click :guilabel:`Add a line`."
msgstr "في عمود :guilabel:`الحقل`، انقر على :guilabel:`إضافة سطر`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:110
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Create rules` window, add a :guilabel:`Field` and create a "
"new :guilabel:`Domain` rule if needed. Then, click :guilabel:`Save & Close`."
msgstr ""
"في نافذة :guilabel:`إنشاء قواعد`، أضف :guilabel:`حقل` وأنشئ "
"قاعدة :guilabel:`نطاق` جديدة إذا لزم الأمر. ثم انقر على :guilabel:`حفظ "
"وإغلاق`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:None
msgid "Using horizontal groups to see each company's contribution."
msgstr "استخدام المجموعات الأفقية لرؤية مساهمة كل شركة."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:117
msgid ""
"When opened, financial reports usually default to a statutory view, using "
"the company's regular ledger (including its consolidation adjustment). To "
"see the full consolidation picture, **make sure to select the multi-ledger** "
"that includes all the consolidation adjustments."
msgstr ""
"عند الفتح، عادةً ما تستخدم التقارير المالية بشكل افتراضي العرض القانوني، "
"باستخدام دفتر الأستاذ العادي للشركة (بما في ذلك تسوية التوحيد الخاصة بها). "
"لرؤية الصورة الكاملة للتوحيد، **تأكد من اختيار دفتر الأستاذ المتعدد** الذي "
"يتضمن جميع تسويات التوحيد."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:123
msgid ""
"**Cumulative Translation Adjustments:** When consolidating companies with "
"different currencies, Odoo handles the translation."
msgstr ""
"**تسويات الترجمة التراكمية:** عند توحيد الشركات بعملات مختلفة، يتولى Odoo "
"عملية الترجمة."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:126
msgid "Equity accounts: Use the historical exchange rate."
msgstr "حسابات الأسهم: استخدم سعر الصرف التاريخي."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:128
msgid ""
"Profit and loss (P&L) accounts (including :ref:`appropriation accounts "
"<accounting/year-end/appropriation>`): Use the weighted average exchange "
"rate."
msgstr ""
"حسابات الأرباح والخسائر (بما في ذلك :ref:`حسابات التخصيص <accounting/year-"
"end/appropriation>`): استخدم متوسط سعر الصرف المرجح."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:131
msgid ""
"Balance sheet accounts (excluding equity): Use the closing exchange rate."
msgstr "حسابات الميزانية العمومية (باستثناء الأسهم): استخدم سعر الصرف الختامي."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:134
msgid "The rates used are those of the company currently selected."
msgstr "أسعار الصرف المستخدمة هي أسعار الشركة المحددة حاليًا."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:139
msgid "Account merging"
msgstr "دمج الحسابات"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:141
msgid ""
"Accounts can be merged to reduce the number of accounts and standardize them "
"across companies. This is optional; consolidation works without it."
msgstr ""
"يمكن دمج الحسابات لتقليل عدد الحسابات وتوحيدها عبر الشركات. هذا اختياري؛ "
"يعمل التوحيد بدونه."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:144
msgid ""
"To use the merge tool, select all the companies with an account that needs "
"to be merged in the company selector in the top right corner of the screen."
msgstr ""
"لاستخدام أداة الدمج، حدد جميع الشركات التي لديها حساب يحتاج إلى الدمج في "
"محدد الشركات في الزاوية اليمنى العليا من الشاشة."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:None
msgid "Selecting all companies that have accounts to be merged."
msgstr "تحديد جميع الشركات التي لديها حسابات يجب دمجها."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:150
msgid ""
"Then, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Chart of "
"Accounts` and select the accounts to merge. Click the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Actions` menu and select :guilabel:`Merge accounts`."
msgstr ""
"بعد ذلك، انتقل إلى :menuselection:`المحاسبة --> الإعدادات --> دليل الحسابات` "
"واختر الحسابات المراد دمجها. انقر على قائمة :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`الإجراءات` واختر :guilabel:`دمج الحسابات`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:154
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Merge accounts` window, enable the :guilabel:`Group by "
"name?` option if needed and click :guilabel:`Merge`."
msgstr ""
"في نافذة :guilabel:`دمج الحسابات`، فعّل خيار :guilabel:`التجميع حسب الاسم؟` "
"إذا لزم الأمر وانقر على :guilabel:`دمج`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:157
msgid ""
"The selected accounts are then merged into a single shared account, "
"accessible by all the chosen companies, just as if the account had been "
"directly created to be shared."
msgstr ""
"يتم بعد ذلك دمج الحسابات المحددة في حساب مشترك واحد، يمكن لجميع الشركات "
"المختارة الوصول إليه، تمامًا كما لو تم إنشاء الحساب مباشرة ليكون مشتركًا."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:163
msgid "Account unmerging"
msgstr "إلغاء دمج الحساب"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:165
msgid "Accounts can also be unmerged if needed."
msgstr "يمكن أيضًا إلغاء دمج الحسابات إذا لزم الأمر."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:169
msgid ""
"Note that unmerging accounts **will not unmerge the chatters** of the "
"accounts. Once merged, the changes' histories are permanently merged."
msgstr ""
"لاحظ أن إلغاء دمج الحسابات **لن يلغي دمج سجلات المحادثات** الخاصة بالحسابات. "
"بمجرد الدمج، يتم دمج سجلات التغييرات بشكل دائم."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:172
msgid ""
"To unmerge accounts, select a company with a shared account in the company "
"selector at the top right corner of the screen. Then, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Chart of Accounts` and "
"select the account to unmerge. Click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` "
"menu and select :guilabel:`Unmerge accounts`."
msgstr ""
"لإلغاء دمج الحسابات، اختر شركة لديها حساب مشترك في محدد الشركات في الزاوية "
"العلوية اليمنى من الشاشة. بعد ذلك، انتقل إلى :menuselection:`المحاسبة --> "
"الإعدادات --> دليل الحسابات` واختر الحساب المراد إلغاء دمجه. انقر على "
"قائمة :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`الإجراءات` واختر :guilabel:`إلغاء دمج "
"الحسابات`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:177
msgid ""
"An :guilabel:`Odoo Warning` confirmation pop-up window will appear, listing "
"how the accounts will be split."
msgstr ""
"ستظهر نافذة تأكيد منبثقة بعنوان :guilabel:`تحذير Odoo`، تسرد كيفية تقسيم "
"الحسابات."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:None
msgid ""
"Confirmation wizard for the Unmerge Tool of the shared accounts feature."
msgstr "معالج التأكيد لأداة إلغاء الدمج الخاصة بميزة الحسابات المشتركة."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:183
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Unmerge`. A new account linked to each company will be "
"created for the previously shared account."
msgstr ""
"انقر على :guilabel:`إلغاء الدمج`. سيتم إنشاء حساب جديد مرتبط بكل شركة للحساب "
"المشترك السابق."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:189
msgid "Import a mapping"
msgstr "استيراد تعيين"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:191
msgid ""
"To **import an account mapping**, select all the related companies in the "
"company selector at the top right corner of the screen and go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Chart of Accounts`."
msgstr ""
"**لاستيراد تعيين حساب**، اختر جميع الشركات ذات الصلة في محدد الشركات في "
"الزاوية العلوية اليمنى من الشاشة وانتقل إلى :menuselection:`المحاسبة --> "
"الإعدادات --> دليل الحسابات`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:195
msgid ""
"First, to choose the fields to export, select the accounts, click "
"the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` button and select :guilabel:`Export`. "
"Then, in the :guilabel:`Export data` window, add the :guilabel:`Code mapping/"
"Code`, :guilabel:`Code Mapping/Company` and :guilabel:`External ID` fields "
"using the :icon:`fa-plus` icon and click :guilabel:`Export`. No other field "
"is required."
msgstr ""
"أولاً، لاختيار الحقول المراد تصديرها، اختر الحسابات، وانقر على زر :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`الإجراءات` واختر :guilabel:`تصدير`. بعد ذلك، في "
"نافذة :guilabel:`تصدير البيانات`، أضف حقول :guilabel:`تعيين الرمز/"
"الرمز`، :guilabel:`تعيين الرمز/الشركة` و :guilabel:`المعرّف الخارجي` باستخدام "
"أيقونة :icon:`fa-plus` وانقر على :guilabel:`تصدير`. لا توجد حقول أخرى مطلوبة."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:201
msgid ""
"Second, rework it in a spreadsheet adding the desired code for each company "
"on desired accounts."
msgstr ""
"ثانيًا، أعد صياغته في جدول بيانات مع إضافة الرمز المطلوب لكل شركة في الحسابات "
"المطلوبة."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:203
msgid ""
"Third, to reimport the file (xlsx or csv format) in Odoo, "
"click :guilabel:`Import` and, in the :guilabel:`Import Chart of Accounts` "
"section, click :guilabel:`Import CoA`. In the :guilabel:`Accounting Import "
"Guide`, drop or click :guilabel:`Upload Data File` to import the file. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`Import`."
msgstr ""
"ثالثًا، لإعادة استيراد الملف (بتنسيق xlsx أو csv) في Odoo، انقر "
"على :guilabel:`استيراد` وفي قسم :guilabel:`استيراد دليل الحسابات`، انقر "
"على :guilabel:`استيراد دليل الحسابات`. في :guilabel:`دليل استيراد المحاسبة`، "
"اسحب أو انقر على :guilabel:`تحميل ملف البيانات` لاستيراد الملف. بعد ذلك، "
"انقر على :guilabel:`استيراد`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:208
msgid ""
"Finally, the codes now take into account the mapping company per company."
msgstr "أخيرًا، تأخذ الرموز الآن في الاعتبار تعيين كل شركة على حدة."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:7
msgid ""
"A company's inventory valuation should include all stock on hand. Accurately "
"recording this value in the accounting records ensures a true representation "
"of the company's current asset value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:10
msgid ""
"The :doc:`Inventory <../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory>` app maintains "
"real-time stock valuation based on physical item movement. In contrast, the "
"Accounting app updates accounting inventory valuation only when specifically "
"requested, most often for closing or (when using perpetual accounting) when "
"vendor bills or customer invoices are posted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:16
msgid ""
"Use the :doc:`../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/"
"cheat_sheet` for guidance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:21
msgid "Accounting standards"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:23
msgid ""
"In accounting, the timing of inventory expense recognition and its impact "
"on :ref:`journal entries <accounting-entries>` differ based on the "
"accounting standard used:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Continental** accounting: the cost of goods is recorded as an expense when "
"the vendor bill is posted, typically upon receipt into stock, regardless of "
"when the goods are sold."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Anglo-Saxon** accounting: the cost of goods sold (COGS) is recognized as "
"an expense when the customer invoice is posted, typically when products are "
"sold."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:36
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`, then "
"scroll to the :guilabel:`Inventory Valuation` section to set the following "
"company-level options:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:39
msgid ""
":ref:`Inventory Valuation <accounting/inventory-valuation/valuation-"
"method>`: Set the valuation method as :guilabel:`Perpetual (at invoicing)` "
"or :guilabel:`Periodic (at closing)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Periodic Valuation`: Set the :ref:`closing entry <accounting/"
"inventory-valuation/closing-entry>` process "
"to :guilabel:`Manual`, :guilabel:`Daily`, or :guilabel:`Monthly` to automate "
"it, if needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:44
msgid ""
":ref:`Inventory Cost Method <costing-methods>`: Choose :guilabel:`Standard "
"Price`, :guilabel:`First in First Out (FIFO)`, or :guilabel:`Average Cost "
"(AVCO)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:46
msgid ""
":ref:`Valuation Account <accounting/inventory-valuation/valuation-account>`: "
"Set the asset account used to record the financial value of physical stock. "
"Then, click the :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`(internal link)` next to "
"the :guilabel:`Valuation Account` field to open the :guilabel:`Stock "
"Valuation` account and update the :ref:`Variation Account <accounting/"
"inventory-valuation/variation-account>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:51
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Journal`: Set the journal to post inventory valuation entries in."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:52
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Other accounts can be defined on \"Inventory Loss\" and "
"\"Production\" on dedicated locations`: If needed, "
"click :guilabel:`locations` and set the :ref:`Inventory Loss <accounting/"
"inventory-valuation/inventory-loss>` or the :ref:`Cost of Production "
"<accounting/inventory-valuation/cost-of-production>` accounts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:58
msgid ""
"Default accounts, inventory valuation methods, and costing methods can be "
"overridden by setting them on the product category form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:64
msgid "Valuation methods"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:66
msgid ""
"The timing and manner of maintaining inventory records vary based on the "
"inventory valuation method:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Periodic (at closing)`: Inventory valuation is updated only when "
"generating entries during the :ref:`stock closing process <accounting/"
"inventory-valuation/closing-entry>`. While inventory movements are tracked "
"physically via the :doc:`Inventory Stock <../../../inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock>` report, they are not "
"automatically synchronized with financial records. When using "
"the :guilabel:`Periodic` inventory valuation method, the expense account is "
"debited when vendor bills are posted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Perpetual (at invoicing)`: Inventory valuation is updated when "
"bills or invoices are posted. The expense account (:abbr:`COGS (Cost of "
"goods sold)`) is debited when invoices are posted. Combined with "
"the :ref:`stock closing process <accounting/inventory-valuation/closing-"
"entry>`, :guilabel:`Perpetual (at invoicing)` inventory valuation is updated "
"for deliveries and receipts, even if there is no invoice or vendor bill yet."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:81
msgid ""
"The periodic valuation method is often associated with Continental "
"standards, while the perpetual method is commonly used with Anglo-Saxon "
"standards. However, companies may choose a different inventory valuation "
"method based on their specific needs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:84
msgid ""
"In :guilabel:`Perpetual` valuation, it is more common to set "
