"If :guilabel:`Included in Price` is set to :guilabel:`Tax Included`, the "
"computation is :math:`\\text{tax amount} = \\text{sales price} \\times "
"\\text{tax rate}`."
msgstr ""
"إذا تم تعيين :guilabel:`مضمّن في السعر` إلى :guilabel:`الضريبة مضمنة`، يكون "
"الحساب :math:`\\text{tax amount} = \\text{sales price} \\times \\text{tax "
