msgstr ""
"بعد ذلك، قم بتفعيل مفتاح :guilabel:`إرسال الأموال` وانقر على :guilabel:`حفظ "
"وإغلاق`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:432
msgid "Using the :guilabel:`Currency` field is optional."
msgstr "استخدام حقل :guilabel:`العملة` اختياري."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:434
