#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:115
msgid ""
"Copy the total :guilabel:`Balance` for those partners for the given period."
msgstr "انسخ إجمالي :guilabel:`الرصيد` لهؤلاء الشركاء للفترة المحددة."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:117
msgid ""
"Once the declaration is correct, click the :icon:`fa-cog` (:guilabel:`action "
